The effect of zinc application on growth and alleviating
shoot concentration of cadmium in durum wheat plant
growth under conditions of salt and cadmium stress
Faruk OZKUTLU1

1

Soil Science and Plant Nutrition,
Agricultural Faculty, Ordu University,
