Phytoremediation of Heavy Metal Contaminated Water
Using Potential Caspian Sea Wetland Plant: Nymphaeaceae
Parisa Ziarati1*, Jinous Asgarpanah2 and Fatemehsadat MirMohammad Makki3
Department of Medicinal Chemistry, Faculty of Pharmacy ,Pharmaceutical Sciences Branch,
Islamic Azad University (IAUPS), Tehran, Iran.
