Microbial Evaluation of Spices in Ethiopia
Tesfaye L. Bedada1,*, Firehiwot A. Derra1, Samson G. Gebre1, Waktole G. Sima1, Redwan M.
Edicho1, Rahel F. Maheder1, Tigist Y. Negassi1 and Yosef B. Asefa2
